<section class="faqs-page" aria-labelledby="faqs-page-title">
  <div class="faqs-page__inner">
    <nav class="faqs-page__breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span>FAQs</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="faqs-page__header">
      <p>Help center</p>
      <h1 id="faqs-page-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
      <span>Clear answers about our products, quality standards, and everyday use.</span>
    </header>

    <div class="faqs-page__content">
      <div class="faqs-page__category">
        <span>01</span>
        <h2>General Inquiries</h2>
        <p>Everything you need to know before adding a supplement to your routine.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faqs-page__list">
        <details open>
          <summary><b>01</b><span>How long does it take to see results from dietary supplements?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>The time to experience results varies based on the supplement and individual factors. Consistency in usage is key. Some may notice changes quickly, while others may require more time.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>02</b><span>Are there potential side effects of dietary supplements?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>While most people tolerate supplements well, side effects can occur, especially when exceeding recommended dosages. Common side effects are usually mild, but it is essential to report any adverse reactions to a healthcare provider.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>03</b><span>How does Cata-Kor ensure the quality of its ingredients?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>We source our ingredients meticulously, prioritizing quality, purity, and sustainability. Our commitment to excellence extends to rigorous testing and adherence to industry-leading standards.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>04</b><span>Are your products gluten-free?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>Yes.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>05</b><span>Are your products non-GMO/organic?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>Yes.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>06</b><span>Are your products safe to take with medications?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>Please consult with a certified healthcare professional before trying any supplement if you are currently taking a medication or have a known medical condition.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary><b>07</b><span>Do you have samples?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary>
          <div><p>Not at this time.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="faqs-page__contact">
      <div>
        <p>Still have a question?</p>
        <h2>We are here to help.</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:hello@catakor.com">Email our team <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQs page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
